<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.yorukefe.com","name":"Haberler"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.yorukefe.com\/siyaset","name":"S\u0130YASET"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.yorukefe.com\/suleyman-bulbul-aydin-yaslaniyor-ama-cozum-uretilemiyor","name":"S\u00fcleyman B\u00fclb\u00fcl: \u201cAyd\u0131n Ya\u015flan\u0131yor Ama \u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcm \u00dcretilemiyor!\u201d"}}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"S\u00fcleyman B\u00fclb\u00fcl: \u201cAyd\u0131n Ya\u015flan\u0131yor Ama \u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcm \u00dcretilemiyor!\u201d","articleSection":"S\u0130YASET","dateCreated":"2026-10-10T21:02:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-10T21:02:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-10T21:09:12+03:00","wordCount":513,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.yorukefe.com\/suleyman-bulbul-aydin-yaslaniyor-ama-cozum-uretilemiyor"},"articleBody":"YEN\u0130 Parti Ayd\u0131n Milletvekili S\u00fcleyman B\u00fclb\u00fcl, Ayd\u0131n\u2019da ya\u015fl\u0131 n\u00fcfus oran\u0131n\u0131n T\u00fcrkiye ortalamas\u0131n\u0131n \u00fczerinde oldu\u011funa dikkat \u00e7ekerek ya\u015fl\u0131 bak\u0131m hizmetlerinin yetersizli\u011fini g\u00fcndeme ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131. B\u00fclb\u00fcl, huzurevlerinde ba\u015fvuru, kabul ve bekleme say\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 sorarken il\u00e7elerde g\u00fcnd\u00fcz ya\u015fl\u0131 bak\u0131m merkezleri a\u00e7\u0131lmas\u0131 ve evde profesyonel bak\u0131m hizmetlerinin yayg\u0131nla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131 \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131nda bulundu.\r\n\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti Ayd\u0131n Milletvekili S\u00fcleyman B\u00fclb\u00fcl, T\u00dc\u0130K\u2019in 2025 y\u0131l\u0131 verilerine g\u00f6re Ayd\u0131n\u2019da 65 ya\u015f ve \u00fczerindeki n\u00fcfusun 190 bin 954 ki\u015fiye ula\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirtti. Ayd\u0131n\u2019da ya\u015fl\u0131 n\u00fcfus oran\u0131n\u0131n y\u00fczde 16,3 oldu\u011funu ifade eden B\u00fclb\u00fcl, T\u00fcrkiye genelindeki y\u00fczde 11,1\u2019lik oranla kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda kentte ya\u015fl\u0131 n\u00fcfusun daha y\u00fcksek bir paya sahip oldu\u011funa dikkat \u00e7ekti.\r\n\r\nAyd\u0131n\u2019\u0131n ya\u015fland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ancak ya\u015fl\u0131 bak\u0131m hizmetlerine ili\u015fkin sorunlara \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm \u00fcretilmedi\u011fini savunan B\u00fclb\u00fcl, iktidar\u0131n kentte ka\u00e7 ki\u015finin bak\u0131ma ihtiya\u00e7 duydu\u011funa ve ka\u00e7 vatanda\u015f\u0131n hizmet bekledi\u011fine ili\u015fkin verileri a\u00e7\u0131klamad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ileri s\u00fcrd\u00fc.\r\n\r\n\u201cHUZUREV\u0130NDE SIRA BEKLEYEN KA\u00c7 K\u0130\u015e\u0130 VAR?\u201d\r\n\r\nAile ve Sosyal Hizmetler Bakan\u0131\u2019n\u0131n 13 Eyl\u00fcl\u2019de Ayd\u0131n\u2019a ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirdi\u011fi ziyarete de\u011finen B\u00fclb\u00fcl, 160 ki\u015filik huzurevinin kapasitesinin a\u00e7\u0131klanmas\u0131na kar\u015f\u0131n ba\u015fvuru ve bekleme say\u0131lar\u0131na ili\u015fkin bilgilerin payla\u015f\u0131lmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirtti.\r\n\r\nB\u00fclb\u00fcl, konuya ili\u015fkin \u015fu sorular\u0131 y\u00f6neltti:\r\n\r\n\u201cSay\u0131n Bakan, kapasiteyi s\u00f6ylediniz. Ba\u015fvuran ka\u00e7 ki\u015fi, kabul edilen ka\u00e7 ki\u015fi, s\u0131ra bekleyen ka\u00e7 ki\u015fi? Evinde bak\u0131m hizmeti bekleyen ka\u00e7 yurtta\u015f\u0131m\u0131z var? Bu sorular\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 neden Ayd\u0131nl\u0131larla payla\u015fmad\u0131n\u0131z?\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cYA\u015eLILAR A\u0130LELER\u0130NDEN UZAKLA\u015eMAK ZORUNDA KALIYOR\u201d\r\n\r\nSahada kar\u015f\u0131la\u015f\u0131lan sorunlara da de\u011finen B\u00fclb\u00fcl, ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 yerde bak\u0131m merkezinde yer bulamayan ya\u015fl\u0131lar\u0131n ailelerinden ve al\u0131\u015ft\u0131klar\u0131 \u00e7evreden uzaktaki merkezlere gitmek zorunda kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6ne s\u00fcrd\u00fc.\r\n\r\nYa\u015fl\u0131 bak\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n ailelerin, \u00f6zellikle de kad\u0131nlar\u0131n kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131ks\u0131z eme\u011fine b\u0131rak\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 ele\u015ftiren B\u00fclb\u00fcl, bak\u0131m hizmetlerinin ihtiya\u00e7 duyulan b\u00f6lgelerde eri\u015filebilir olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini vurgulad\u0131.\r\n\r\nYA\u015eLI BAKIMI \u0130\u00c7\u0130N \u00dc\u00c7 \u00d6NER\u0130\r\n\r\nB\u00fclb\u00fcl, Ayd\u0131n\u2019da ya\u015fl\u0131 bak\u0131m hizmetlerinin geli\u015ftirilmesi i\u00e7in \u015fu ad\u0131mlar\u0131n at\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131 istedi:\r\n\r\n\r\n \u0130l\u00e7elerde g\u00fcnd\u00fcz ya\u015fl\u0131 bak\u0131m merkezleri a\u00e7\u0131lmas\u0131.\r\n Evde profesyonel bak\u0131m hizmetlerinin yayg\u0131nla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131.\r\n Bak\u0131m veren aile fertlerinin sigorta ve emeklilik haklar\u0131n\u0131n g\u00fcvence alt\u0131na al\u0131nmas\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\nYa\u015fl\u0131lar\u0131n bak\u0131m hizmeti alabilmek i\u00e7in ailelerinden uzakla\u015fmak zorunda kalmamas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini belirten B\u00fclb\u00fcl, bak\u0131m hizmetlerinin ihtiya\u00e7 duyulan yerde ve zamanda eri\u015filebilen bir hak olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini ifade etti.","description":"YEN\u0130 Parti Ayd\u0131n Milletvekili S\u00fcleyman B\u00fclb\u00fcl, Ayd\u0131n\u2019da ya\u015fl\u0131 n\u00fcfus oran\u0131n\u0131n T\u00fcrkiye ortalamas\u0131n\u0131n \u00fczerinde oldu\u011funa dikkat \u00e7ekerek ya\u015fl\u0131 bak\u0131m\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/yorukefecom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/yorukefe-com\/uploads\/2026\/10\/whatsapp-image-2026-10-10-at-210844.jpeg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"S\u00fcleyman B\u00fclb\u00fcl: \u201cAyd\u0131n Ya\u015flan\u0131yor Ama \u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcm \u00dcretilemiyor!\u201d"},"publishingPrinciples":"https:\/\/www.yorukefe.com\/yayin-ilkeleri","isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.yorukefe.com\/#organization","name":"Y\u00f6r\u00fck Efe Gazetesi \u00ae\ufe0f | Ayd\u0131n Haberler","image":"https:\/\/yorukefecom.teimg.com\/yorukefe-com\/images\/banner\/web-site-yeni-logo-yeh.png","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/yorukefecom.teimg.com\/yorukefe-com\/images\/banner\/web-site-yeni-logo-yeh.png","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Selva Demir","url":"https:\/\/www.yorukefe.com\/muhabir\/8\/selva-demir"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Selva Demir","url":"https:\/\/www.yorukefe.com\/muhabir\/8\/selva-demir"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.yorukefe.com\/#organization","name":"Y\u00f6r\u00fck Efe Gazetesi \u00ae\ufe0f | Ayd\u0131n Haberler","url":"https:\/\/www.yorukefe.com"}}</script>









</head>




